OL,3,CAndy Burnham backs calls for funeral
OL,4,Cindustry regulation
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has backed calls to
OL,7,Fregulate funeral homes and mortuaries
OL,8,Fas a disgraced funeral director was
OL,9,Fjailed over the burial and treatment
OL,10,Fof dead bodies.
OL,12,FThe Prime Minister offered his
OL,13,Fsympathies to the victims of disgraced
OL,14,Ffuneral director Robert Bush as he was
OL,15,Fjailed on Friday afternoon for
OL,16,Foffences at his business, Legacy
OL,17,FIndependent Funeral Directors.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
