OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785521911
OL,3,CAndy Burnham backs calls for funeral
OL,4,Cindustry regulation
OL,6,FBush pleaded guilty to 67 charges over
OL,7,F12 years, affecting hundreds of
OL,8,Fvictims at his business. Prosecutors
OL,9,Fsaid Bush's case is "unprecedented".
OL,11,FA separate independent inquiry into
OL,12,Fthe crimes of David Fuller, who abused
OL,13,Fat least 100 dead women and girls in
OL,14,Fhospital mortuaries in south-east
OL,15,FEngland, recommended regulation of the
OL,16,Ffuneral sector to prevent similar
OL,17,Fcrimes being committed again.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
