FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785521911
OL,3,CAndy Burnham backs calls for funeral
OL,4,Cindustry regulation
OL,6,FSpeaking on a visit to Sheffield, Mr
OL,7,FBurnham said: "I do back those calls,
OL,8,Fand there were recommendations in the
OL,9,FFuller Report that will be implemented
OL,10,Fbecause we have seen appalling
OL,11,Fsituations like this before.
OL,13,F"I feel for the families and I know
OL,14,Fit'll be a difficult day for them with
OL,15,Fthese matters in court again. I was
OL,16,Ftruly horrified when I heard what had
OL,17,Fhappened. Appalling for any family to
OL,18,Fgo through that. This needs a proper
OL,19,Fresponse in terms of the regulation
OL,20,Fneeded, to make sure no family goes
OL,21,Fthrough that again.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785521911
OL,3,CAndy Burnham backs calls for funeral
OL,4,Cindustry regulation
OL,6,F"People, I think, would assume that
OL,7,Fthe highest standards apply to this
OL,8,Farea and we've got to make sure that
OL,9,Fthey do apply and that there can't be
OL,10,Fany repeat of what we've seen."
OL,12,FThis week a court has heard that Bush,
OL,13,F48, breached the trust of grieving
OL,14,Ffamilies "on an almost industrial
OL,15,Fscale" by keeping bodies for months
OL,16,Fafter they should have been cremated,
OL,17,Fgiving out the wrong ashes, taking
OL,18,Fmoney for funeral plans without making
OL,19,Fany arrangements, and stealing charity
OL,20,Fdonations collected at services.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
