CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785521911
OL,3,CAndy Burnham backs calls for funeral
OL,4,Cindustry regulation
OL,6,FIn April, he pleaded guilty to 30
OL,7,Fcounts of preventing a lawful and
OL,8,Fdecent burial, and theft from 12
OL,9,Fcharities as he did not pass on
OL,10,Fdonations given at funerals.
OL,12,FBush previously admitted to 30 counts
OL,13,Fof fraud by false representation
OL,14,Frelating to bodies found at the site,
OL,15,Fand four "foetus allegations" of
OL,16,Ffraud, where he presented ashes to
OL,17,Fwomen falsely saying that they were
OL,18,F"the remains of their unborn".
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
